+### Deterministic snapshot procedure
+
+- Fixture source/expected facts are immutable inputs with hashes. Pin HTML/JSON bytes, object/key/route order, UTC wall-clock seed `2026-01-01T00:00:00+00:00`, fixture project name and origin `http://127.0.0.1:8765` for snapshot runs. If port unavailable, report blocked rather than choose another origin or overwrite another run. Other control fixtures may use ephemeral ports and are not this exact-byte snapshot.
+- Keep monotonic elapsed/pacing measurements real; the fixed wall-clock is a test injection only. Input bytes do not embed random ports/IDs. Use a fresh isolated output root; no delete/reuse of existing runs. Fixture snapshot variant and clock injection are test-only, never live settings.
+- Before comparison: validate structure/references, recompute **all actual artifact/source hashes**, assert source byte equality at the declared boundary, object-array deep equality, route/outcome/count facts, time ordering, bounds and measured pacing. Failures here cannot be normalized away.
+- A comparison view (never written back over raw evidence) substitutes only named volatile tool metadata: manifest started_at/finished_at/pages[].fetched_at/pages[].elapsed_s, absences[].at, indexed response started_at/finished_at/elapsed_s and log event timestamps/elapsed timings, pack built_at/prepare_version, runtime versions/tool_commit, plus generated run_id/pack_id and occurrences in **declared tool references**. Validate version/commit values against the independently recorded current environment before substitution. Preserve operation order, per-event gap assertions, status/outcome/URL/counts and non-timing log content. No recursive string replacement in source fields.
+- Fixed port avoids source-byte port normalization. If a non-snapshot test uses another port, compare against its independently instantiated input facts, not the fixed-port byte snapshot. Never strip arbitrary URL ports from actual evidence.
+- Hashes of untouched HTML/REST/image evidence must equal the fixture's byte hashes exactly. Hashes of volatile **tool-authored metadata** are first verified against actual referenced files, then replaced in the comparison view by the digest of the canonical comparison view of that same referenced file, working from leaves to parents. Preserve every hash/reference edge, hash algorithm and path; reject cycles/unrecognized volatile fields. Do not drop hashes or bless them solely by ignoring differences. This also applies to pack artifact hashes/source manifest hash and twin header IDs.
+- Compare full file inventory and canonical JSON/maps (sort object keys; preserve meaningful array order); render expected twin facts from separately declared assertions and compare escaped presentation. Normalize only generated timestamp/ID headers for Markdown/logs; raw quoted content is not normalized. Compare raw file bytes verbatim. Future `venv/bin/python tests/regen_fixtures.py --check --variant complete --stage capture` at C6/CHK and `--stage pipeline` at E1 regenerate into a NEW temp output and exits nonzero on any difference; no automatic overwrite/accept-golden mode. Reviewer records factual expected-snapshot changes before Tony commits them.
