+Observe/count browser resources by host/type/status separately. Already in-flight resources can finish after stop; admission logs distinguish prevented versus dispatched versus unknown. No timeout retry, fallback-client switch, retry after Retry-After, or implicit resume. Lower fixture limits prove enforcement without spending live budgets. Engineering checks/reports register actual consumed/remaining counts/time/disk; SOL may reuse candidate-bound CHK/E2 evidence, never automatically schedule another pair.
