+After Tony commits and creates QA branch, Q1 independently reads the candidate tree (`git ls-tree -r <candidate>` and `git show <candidate>:<path>`, no mutation), hashes committed blob bytes and compares modes/symlink targets with the engineering inventory. Reconcile all candidate added/changed product/config/test/fixture/governing paths, not just the old file list, so a new uncaptured file cannot escape comparison. Runtime/lock identity and commands must also match or have an explicit impact disposition. Record an immutable **binding attestation** naming original evidence inventory/hash, base/dirty specimen, actual candidate SHA and any differences. Never edit raw evidence to replace its base SHA with the new candidate.
